  "Max Money On Change":
    Games:
      "Persona 5 (Artemis)":
        NPUB31848: [ 01.00 ]
    Author: Hiei-YYH Ported by ChiDreams
    Notes: Money might appear as 0 in in the shop windows if you turn this on while playing. That can be fixed closing and re-entering the shop windows.
    Patch Version: 1.2 
