PPU-e72e715d646a94770d1902364bc66fe33b1b6606:
  "Stop Day Date Advance":
    Games:
      "Persona 5 (Artemis)":
        NPUB31848: [ 01.00 ]
    Author: Hiei-YYH Ported by ChiDreams
    Notes: This code helps make the date loop on the same day, so an event that happened in this day will keep repeating itself without affecting the end of the story giving you free time during afternoons or other moments to boost arcana and so on. De-activate it to continue story mode.
    Patch Version: 1.2 
    Patch:
      - [ load, *Persona55 ]
PPU-e72e715d646a94770d1902364bc66fe33b1b6606:
  "Stop Time Flow":
    Games:
      "Persona 5 (Artemis)":
        NPUB31848: [ 01.00 ]
    Author: Hiei-YYH Ported by ChiDreams
    Notes: This is the same Stop Day Date Advance, but will only lock in the time you activated it at, like mid afternoon or evening then it will keep on a loop in this time. Both lacks a button combo to be activated or deactivated mid-game without netcheat. It is safe to use and de-activate through netcheat any time.
    Patch Version: 1.2 
    Patch:
      - [ load, *Persona56 ]
PPU-e72e715d646a94770d1902364bc66fe33b1b6606:
  "Arcana Experience Multiplier (Vows And Friendship)":
    Games:
      "Persona 5 (Artemis)":
