PPU-e72e715d646a94770d1902364bc66fe33b1b6606:
  "Detection Gauge Always 0":
    Games:
      "Persona 5 (Artemis)":
        NPUB31848: [ 01.00 ]
    Author: Hiei-YYH Ported by ChiDreams
    Notes: This code helps with palace exploration, but once you are ready to send the calling card, de-activate this one or the game will lock in a loop trying to fill the detection gauge to 99 since all boss parts it needs to force detection to the highest.
    Patch Version: 1.2 
    Patch:
      - [ load, *Persona513 ]
